# Real deployments live in networks/<tailnet>/ and stay on this machine:
# they hold addresses, node IDs, SSIDs and public IPs.
# The examples and the README in networks/ ARE committed.
networks/*
!networks/README.md
!networks/example-host.json
!networks/example-remote.json

# Legacy naming, kept so any pre-move files stay ignored rather than
# accidentally committed.
config-*
tailnet-*
